{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/Cargo.toml","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T16:57:10.678623Z","id":"521d82d66dbda06e8b8c85798c3f68306e2eb87e2955ff712b01a240ac87e94a","body":{"detail":"third_party/clax-rquickjs-sys ships QuickJS bindings for aarch64/x86_64 macOS and Linux only, so clax-bot-js is left out on android and ios (this target table, and deps_not_on in crates/clax-server/BUILD.bazel through bazel/cargo.bzl); crates/clax-server/src/bot.rs sandbox() then gives UnavailableSandbox. Bindings generated for aarch64-linux-android, x86_64-linux-android, aarch64-apple-ios and aarch64-apple-ios-sim would let the app run scripts.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":67},"end":{"line":72},"content_hash":"251bc03527a27d1ed89aa92d525b4f724ec6f0e4ff2678591da7e579ea7132ab"},"summary":"The Clax app on Android and iOS has no ClaxBot script sandbox: every script there ends unavailable and its run waits","tags":["claxbot","app","session:claude-code:7580ce1b-abf0-421d-8a2a-2be245f95865"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/BUILD.bazel","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-12T18:50:43.741890Z","id":"26c3242e65a42d7695075c132b5987b88c13b50dbfe21adf9130f4af97cfaf0e","body":{"detail":"test_data of cargo_package applies to every test target of the package (bazel/cargo.bzl:217 and the split at 330-347), so the nine //crates/<crate>:rust_sources added for the one test api_bot_surfaces::no_source_of_the_daemon_names_a_hosts_surface (crates/clax-server/tests/api_bot_surfaces.rs:1914) are inputs of //crates/clax-server:integration__1 to __6 and :clax_server_lib_test. Evidence: `bazelisk query --keep_going 'rdeps(//crates/clax-server:all, //crates/clax-worker:rust_sources)'` lists clax_server_lib_test and integration__1..6, while `rdeps(//crates/clax-server:all, //crates/clax-worker:lib)` lists nothing. So any edit of a clax-worker, clax-cli or clax-commands source (none of them a dependency of clax-server, crates/clax-server/Cargo.toml) now re-runs the whole clax-server suite under `just test-affected` and invalidates its cached results, which AGENTS.md's test-affected loop and the shared Bazel cache (docs/bazel.md) rely on staying narrow.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":28},"end":{"line":41},"content_hash":"6f21b1da3e2b42cf8b37fed6f0259d40bae9c03f474344cb7c6626f2fddfd75e"},"suggested_fix":"Move the scan out of the integration targets: a small test target of its own (a separate [[test]] in clax-server without split_tests, or a //scripts check like //scripts:no_unsafe) that alone takes the rust_sources as data, so only it re-runs when those crates' sources change.","summary":"The source scan's test_data makes all six clax-server integration shards and its unit tests depend on the sources of clax-worker, clax-cli and clax-commands, which clax-server does not depend on","tags":["review","review:claxbot-surfaces-deep","session:claude-code:443e6ffa-9215-48fe-9313-5be76354ae11"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/BUILD.bazel","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-12T18:52:35.094865Z","id":"d633199a950cd201bc4dc49aef08ff6018a563745b1aa912729c4f1f8b3c7b69","body":{"detail":"`git diff main...HEAD -- crates/clax-server/BUILD.bazel` shows this branch adding nine //crates/*:rust_sources to test_data (lines 28-41), among them clax-cli, clax-commands and clax-worker; crates/clax-server/Cargo.toml names none of those three. bazel/cargo.bzl:214-215 (test_kwargs: data = own_files + test_data) applies test_data to every test target, including each split shard (cargo.bzl:330-347). `bazelisk query --keep_going 'rdeps(//crates/clax-server:all, //crates/clax-worker:rust_sources)'` prints //crates/clax-server:clax_server_lib_test and :integration__1 to :integration__6. The same query on //crates/clax-worker:lib prints 'INFO: Empty results'. Both runs also print the unrelated android NDK error from //bazel/wasm:c_tools.","kind":"comment","references":"26c3242e65a42d7695075c132b5987b88c13b50dbfe21adf9130f4af97cfaf0e","summary":"confirmed: the added test_data makes every clax-server test target depend on the sources of crates clax-server does not depend on","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:443e6ffa-9215-48fe-9313-5be76354ae11"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/BUILD.bazel","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-12T21:08:59.299257Z","id":"98867ed6aeced5e636ce886f916a9fdf149da0cd9e7d03db92c62a0166f4fafa","body":{"detail":"`bazelisk query 'rdeps(//crates/clax-server:all, //crates/clax-worker:rust_sources)'` now lists //crates/clax-server:daemon_sources alone. A planted `\"shell.triage\"` at the top of crates/clax-worker/src/bot.rs made //crates/clax-server:daemon_sources fail (`crates/clax-server/../clax-worker/src/bot.rs:1: pub const PLANTED …`); the plant was removed and the target passes.","kind":"comment","references":"26c3242e65a42d7695075c132b5987b88c13b50dbfe21adf9130f4af97cfaf0e","summary":"Fixed: the scan is its own [[test]], crates/clax-server/tests/daemon_sources.rs, and the other crates' rust_sources are given to that target alone through cargo_package's new test_data_of (bazel/cargo.bzl)","tags":["session:claude-code:443e6ffa-9215-48fe-9313-5be76354ae11"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/BUILD.bazel","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-12T22:52:21.971815Z","id":"1993de25ac700e00f95a133843f34dfb8abc8c9efcc5008def2b18f702e22759","body":{"detail":"crates/clax-server/BUILD.bazel 42-55: `test_data_of = {\"daemon_sources\": [... clax-cli, clax-commands, clax-worker ... rust_sources]}`. `bazelisk query --keep_going 'rdeps(//crates/clax-server:all, //crates/clax-worker:rust_sources)'` printed only //crates/clax-worker:rust_sources and //crates/clax-server:daemon_sources; the same for //crates/clax-cli:rust_sources. //crates/clax-server:daemon_sources (cached) PASSED.","kind":"comment","references":"26c3242e65a42d7695075c132b5987b88c13b50dbfe21adf9130f4af97cfaf0e","summary":"fix verified: the other crates' rust_sources are data of //crates/clax-server:daemon_sources alone","tags":["fix:verified","session:claude-code:443e6ffa-9215-48fe-9313-5be76354ae11"]}}
